  <ym-title|Selected-scale local response
  package><label|selected-scale-local-response-package>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, selected-scale trace producer.

    <item>Status: draft; the simultaneous finite-probe and price bookkeeping
    is proved here. The finite-volume insertion and primitive comparison
    receipts are cross-referenced to the canonical principal-comparison
    sections, which have bounded review passes under their displayed
    hypotheses.

